## Method

- Inspect current crscraper v0.0.35 agents/workflow/governance conventions and handoff identity.
- Capture current Chrome, Cat Catch, JDownloader Packagizer and WXT source evidence.
- Route source facts through references/findings/matrices instead of ADRs.
