The repository is ready to begin STEP-01 as v0.0.1 once v0.0.0 governance/recovery sealing passes. v0.0.0 itself does not accept a capture engine, token grammar, persistent schema, application stack, or final page-mapping model.

## Recommendations

Promote v0.0.0 only after the scoped governance validations and deterministic recovery seal pass. Then authorize **v0.0.1 / ROADMAP-0001 STEP-01 only**.

## Unresolved questions

All architecture questions assigned to STEP-01 through STEP-04 remain intentionally unresolved.

## Closure / follow-up

The audit closes when v0.0.0 validates/seals and the handoff points only to ROADMAP-0001 STEP-01.

