# AUDIT-0004 - v0.0.3 ROADMAP-0001 STEP-03 Research Completion

## Objective

Assess whether STEP-03 defines page/document identity, CSS/XPath/read/cardinality/fallback semantics, stale-result behavior, page/field token provenance, mapping reuse/freeze and Preview behavior strongly enough for STEP-04 stack/persistence/frontend research without beginning extension implementation.

## Scope and method

- Fresh-check the latest crscraper governance donor before mutation; freeze exact v0.0.37 and inspect only bounded page-mapping/document-lifecycle evidence read-only.
- Refresh current Chrome `webNavigation`, `scripting`, `runtime`/MessageSender and `webRequest` document identity authority plus primary DOM/XPath/HTML selector/read standards.
- Separate source facts, donor observations and crsniffer interpretations in governed research-data/findings.
- Compare selector/read/cardinality/fallback, document/navigation/staleness, and field-token/dependency/Preview scenarios in three matrices.
- Preserve the research-only boundary: no donor code execution and no crsniffer product/runtime/browser probe implementation.

## Findings

| Area | Accepted STEP-03 research disposition |
| --- | --- |
| Page identity | separate top-level PageContext from request initiating document; candidate key WatchSession + tabId + topDocumentId + pageRevision |
| Cross-document stale boundary | new top-level `documentId` invalidates prior snapshots immediately |
| Same-document SPA/history | keep documentId, increment/invalidate pageRevision/snapshot reuse |
| DOM freshness | evaluate referenced fields on demand; no baseline always-on MutationObserver or permanent freshness claim |
| Execution identity | target exact document ID candidate and verify returned document/context before consumption |
| CSS/XPath | CSS static nodes; XPath typed scalars or ordered node snapshots |
| Reads | text_content, inner_text, attribute, direct primitive property; raw XPath scalar; defer inner/outer HTML |
| Cardinality/fallback | first/optional_one/exact_one/many; Missing distinct; fallback only on Missing/explicit rejection, not errors |
| Mapping reuse | reusable named definitions; Watch freezes only referenced enabled dependencies |
| Tokens | activate exact-context `${page.url}`, `${page.origin}`, `${page.title}`, `${field.<slug>}`; stale/unattributed => Missing |
| Preview | same mapping and Packagizer semantic engines as live; structural redacted durable diagnostics |

## Pre-change recovery

The official `v0.0.3-pre` capture was created from the exact promoted v0.0.2 predecessor tree before semantic STEP-03 mutation, including the empty governed record directories that Git itself cannot track. Its tree identity matches promoted v0.0.2.

## Acceptance assessment

STEP-03 satisfies the roadmap research questions and acceptance evidence. The page mapping contract now distinguishes top-document context from request initiator identity, treats document ID as the hard stale boundary, handles same-document navigation without pretending it is a new document, uses typed snapshot-based CSS/XPath semantics, and specifies fail-closed field-token provenance. CONSTRAINT-0005 prevents implementation from quietly substituting current-tab state for exact historical page context or turning page mapping into ambient/programmable scraping.

No architecture ADR is created. STEP-05 remains the authority for final public architecture acceptance after STEP-04 stack/persistence/frontend evidence exists.

## Recommendations

- Mark ROADMAP-0001 STEP-03 complete in v0.0.3.
- Authorize only **v0.0.4 / STEP-04** next.
- STEP-04 should select stack/storage/frontend mechanisms capable of implementing CONSTRAINT-0003/0004/0005 without weakening them.
- Keep all production extension/runtime/test/probe code absent through STEP-04 research.

## Closure / follow-up

Close STEP-03 when managed-record/initialization/iteration/roadmap/research-scope checks, donor hash verification, Git transition replay, and deterministic recovery sealing pass. Next authorized work is v0.0.4 / ROADMAP-0001 STEP-04 only.

