# AUDIT-0008 — v0.0.20 ROADMAP-0003 STEP-02 Watch Primary Control UX

## Audit objective

Determine whether STEP-02 delivers the complete pre-Watch/active-Watch control experience without pulling STEP-03 resource browsing or later Rules/Page Fields/Settings work forward and without weakening durable/runtime authority.

## Accepted implementation

- Watch setup is a form-first disposable working copy with native saved-setup selection, New, Save as, revision-fenced Update and Reset.
- Default Watch remains the built-in first-run setup; it cannot be silently mutated.
- Images/Videos are simple choices; include/exclude URL patterns are progressively disclosed and validated before Start.
- Start requires an exact clean persisted Watch definition revision. Loading/editing never starts or silently saves.
- Active Watch shows immutable saved setup/filter and original target context; later editor or saved-definition changes apply only to future sessions.
