# MATRIX-0016 — Whole-Product UI/UX Interaction Grammar and Roadmap Ownership

## Question / objective

What user-facing interaction law applies across Watch / Rules / Settings, what current authority exists through v0.0.24, and which exact ROADMAP-0003 step owns each remaining gap?

## Shared interaction grammar

| Interaction | Frozen meaning |
| --- | --- |
| select saved item / Use | deep-copy into working copy; no execution or durable mutation |
| New | new unsaved working copy |
| Saved | working copy equals its loaded durable source revision |
| Unsaved changes | local working copy differs or has no durable identity |
| Save as | create new durable definition |
| Update | revision-checked mutation of loaded durable definition |
| Reset | discard local edits and reload current durable source after dirty confirmation |
| Duplicate | make new unsaved copy with no durable identity |
| Delete | STEP-07 only; unreferenced saved definitions only; never rewrites historical WatchSessions |
| revision conflict | fail closed; preserve work; Reload latest or Save as new |
| enable/disable | only where existing domain semantics are valid; show dependency effect |
| reorder | working-copy order; Move up/down always; drag optional convenience only |
| advanced detail | progressive disclosure; never hides critical error/permission/stale/destructive scope |
| Watch Start | only persisted accepted Watch revision (or built-in Default Watch), never dirty unsaved working copy |
| Preview/Test | may consume transient values only where later step explicitly preserves same-engine semantics; never auto-save |
| Page assist | explicit exact-document isolated-world action under existing optional site access |

## Vocabulary contract

| Use in normal UI | Avoid as normal label |
| --- | --- |
| Current page / Watched page | target tab ID |
| Site access | host permission/origin authority |
| Images / Videos | filter booleans/schema keys |
| Include URL patterns / Exclude URL patterns | includeGlobs / excludeGlobs |
| Resource / Occurrences | ResourceObservation / projection / dedup key |
| Watch setup | watch definition ID |
| Rule / Template | Packagizer definition record |
| Token | raw namespace trace by default |
| Page Field | pageFieldMapping definition |
| Page changed / Stale page | document revision mismatch |
| History retention / Clear data | store/quota primitives |
| Diagnostics | raw structural payload by default |

