Disposition:

- adopt whole-product interaction grammar, structured/form-first editing, optional reuse, explicit dirty/save/update/reset semantics, progressive disclosure, non-drag ordering, consistent states and final usability certification;
- adapt draft execution because crsniffer's immutable WatchSession currently composes only from persisted saved definitions;
