Use `agents/scripts/iteration-manager.py` to create drafts, render the changelog, seal, validate, and verify entries. Do not hand-edit a sealed `changes.diff`, and do not silently rewrite a sealed `change.md`.

Recovery snapshots are separate external workspace-state artifacts governed by `agents/governance/recovery.md`; do not store them in this ledger.
